{"unit_id":"daidashi__dsh-side-chat#card-zh","repo":"daidashi/dsh-side-chat","commit":"1746578a02f73d624beaaa4999451619894300f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-side-chat 是面向 DSH Desktop 的辅助对话插件，会把当前会话在最近完成的回合处分叉为可独立继续的子会话，并嵌入右侧栏。它通过开始页卡片打开真实会话面板，继承父会话的模型路由与预设，并在标签中隐藏继承的历史前缀。用户可以同时保留主对话、创建多个辅助对话、从正文选取文字作为草稿引用，也可在关闭标签时归档子会话。适合需要围绕当前任务并行追问、同时保留主线工作的 DSH Desktop 用户。需要兼容的 DSH Desktop 内核；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-26","lib/fork.js:126-147","client/src/index.jsx:336-365","client/src/filter.js:67-85"]}
{"unit_id":"daidashi__dsh-side-chat#card-en","repo":"daidashi/dsh-side-chat","commit":"1746578a02f73d624beaaa4999451619894300f7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-side-chat forks a DSH Desktop session at a completed turn and opens the child in the right sidebar. It inherits the model route and preset, hides prior history, and lets you quote selected text into a draft. Closing the tab archives the child. Requires a compatible DSH kernel; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-26","lib/fork.js:126-147","client/src/index.jsx:336-365","client/src/filter.js:67-85"]}
